                                                "sense_id": "4f1a3acb-1182-3e33-9f04-8d6e4836764d",
                                                "text": "But they will come away with an enhanced understanding of, and even sympathy for, the man who, according to at least one of his associates, was the “supreme gangster in the U.S., the top man … the big boss.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
